
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Website design · Johannesburg, Gauteng</span>
        <h1>Websites for Johannesburg businesses that get you found first.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Joburg is the busiest place in the country to compete on Google. When someone searches for a plumber in Randburg or a salon in Sandton, the businesses with a proper website and Google profile get the call.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Thabo&#x27;s Plumbing — geysers and leaks in Randburg and Roodepoort">Get a free mockup of your site</button>
          <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See what it costs</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__freebie"><span class="hero__freebie-tag">Free</span> We build a preview of your site first: no deposit, no obligation. Websites from R1,000, with a fixed quote before you pay anything.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="whyTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Why it matters in Johannesburg</span>
          <h2 id="whyTitle">Your next customer is searching right now.</h2>
          <p class="lead" style="font-size:1.05rem">In Johannesburg there&#x27;s almost always someone else offering what you do a few kilometres away. Customers compare two or three businesses on their phone before they call, and the one that shows prices, real photos and a WhatsApp button usually wins. A fast, simple site is how a small business holds its own next to bigger competitors.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="card card--tint reveal">
          <h3>What people in Johannesburg type into Google</h3>
          <div class="area-searches"><span class="area-search"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>"plumber Randburg"</span><span class="area-search"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>"hair salon Sandton"</span><span class="area-search"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>"electrician Roodepoort"</span></div>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">A website that names your area, plus a Google profile with the right service area, is how you show up for searches like these.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

